  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186087699,
      "id": "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09",
      "title": "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "07ff6227-9fbd-5968-b892-35bbf1597ab7",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $AB = BA = I_{2}$\n2. $AC = CA = I_{2}$\n3. $B = A^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We must check whether each pair multiplies to $I_2$.\n\nComputing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "39c84587-9528-5fed-b95b-146be3a8c03b",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "7f801b65-a828-5e40-b366-85bb5ebb9723",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "e43109d2-fdfa-5569-b62f-6db3d2ef8642",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4b198cad-6bab-5926-951e-d6b457da1201",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "None"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "ee827b24-3cca-5c84-9a26-e1616c8336a4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
